RELAXED_BOX 71.6763640910988 71.6790505011651 71.6810198600741

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-382.341594188569)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-382.341594188569)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
